# Who must review what. With branch protection ("Require review from Code
# Owners") these lines are the ownership model of the platform.
# scripts/set-repo-url.sh --owner rewrites @platformengr to your user or org.

# Platform team: everything by default, in particular infrastructure, the
# inventory, ApplicationSets, add-ons, policies and the namespace baseline.
*                               @platformengr/platform-team

# Product declarations: the product team proposes, the platform team approves.
/products/checkout/             @platformengr/team-checkout @platformengr/platform-team

# Product deployment config: owned by the product team alone. Production
# changes additionally wait for the "production" environment approval
# (.github/workflows/production-gate.yaml).
/product-deployments/checkout/  @platformengr/team-checkout
